79
00:05:55,580 --> 00:05:57,560
Dragons don't fly like a bird.

80
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:00,555
They create clouds and grab onto them.

81
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,420
They run through the sky.

82
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:07,520
