and that's what I'm going to do

102
00:07:27,460 --> 00:07:30,180
Yeah, of course, but that won't work.

103
00:07:30,340 --> 00:07:31,987
You can't just shove it away

104
00:07:33,060 --> 00:07:34,740
Then what do you suggest?

105
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:38,425
Look, we've nearly reached
the capital already.

106
00:07:38,660 --> 00:07:40,680
