113
00:07:56,820 --> 00:07:58,173
You're asking too much.

114
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:00,520
I barely even know how to fly.

115
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:05,777
Besides, we cannot be certain that
I have the same abilities as Kaido.

116
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:08,220
