117
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,460
You can do it.

118
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:17,780
no one is coming to help us and the
situation is more serious than we thought

119
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:20,837
if kaido's plan succeeds
there will be countless

120
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:23,537
fatalities in the capital but that's not

121
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:26,777
the worst case scenario
anymore if kaido runs

122
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:28,937
