the size of a mountain on the city

128
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:51,497
and it's too late to warn them we're far

129
00:08:51,580 --> 00:08:54,117
too close they wouldn't
have time to evacuate

130
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:57,557
our allies would all die
and the capital would

131
00:08:57,640 --> 00:09:01,960
burn to ashes let's go
back we have to stop luffy

132
