154
00:10:44,860 --> 00:10:46,240
You just cut my ass!

155
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:48,834
A shame I didn't cut your neck instead.

156
00:10:49,180 --> 00:10:50,360
I hate you!

157
00:10:51,660 --> 00:10:53,440
Zoro just made a big mistake.

158
00:10:54,100 --> 00:10:57,629
