174
00:12:23,420 --> 00:12:27,500
I won't forgive you for trying
to kill me without your sword.

175
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,430
You hear me?

176
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:32,060
I won't forgive you either.

177
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,440
Are you doubting what I said?

178
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:39,560
It does sound absurd, I admit.

179
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,460
So, anything else?

180
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:44,780
In terms of the dragon's
origin, I do have a theory,

181
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:47,238
though I can't guess their identity.

182
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:50,520
That must be a man-made Devil Fruit, Dr.

183
