189
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:09,620
A contingency plan, in case Kaido loses.

190
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:14,237
The land of Wano, currently
unaffiliated with the world government,

191
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:16,597
is to be placed under our direct control,

192
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:17,974
effective immediately.

193
00:13:18,300 --> 00:13:20,317
They've already sent a small fleet.

194
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,900
They will be ready soon.

195
