30,000 troops on the island.

200
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:38,260
Now he's down to roughly 12,000.

201
00:13:39,180 --> 00:13:43,797
The samurai started with 5,400
troops, but now are 8,000 strong.

202
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:47,700
I admit it's been fascinating
to watch this battle unfold,

203
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:52,400
but as for Kaido facing
defeat, I can't imagine it.

204
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,437
As I thought.

205
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:57,617
Keep me updated.

206
00:13:57,700 --> 00:14:00,980
Also, I received one more order. Yes?

207
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:09,337
You must bring in Nico Robin.

208
