It doesn't matter who wins tonight.

209
00:14:12,340 --> 00:14:13,928
Both pirate crews need her.

210
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:16,476
She's the key to everything for them.

211
00:14:16,780 --> 00:14:18,517
