with an overbearing fan base.

233
00:15:15,980 --> 00:15:17,337
And I know just the thing.

234
00:15:17,420 --> 00:15:19,617
What a star needs is a good bodyguard.

235
00:15:19,700 --> 00:15:21,560
And I've got the best, my hero.

236
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:26,961
You're making me blush and
I don't even have skin.

237
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:29,480
Get back here!

238
00:15:35,820 --> 00:15:39,440
Come forth and be powerful, please!

239
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:45,304
