241
00:15:53,700 --> 00:15:55,980
Okay, Momonosuke. New plan.

242
00:15:57,280 --> 00:15:58,360
Don't be upset.

243
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:02,497
But in case the island does fall, I
need to try to minimize the damage.

244
00:16:02,580 --> 00:16:04,737
I'm going back to the Skull Dome now.

245
00:16:04,820 --> 00:16:05,650
No!

246
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:07,080
