254
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,061
You can't leave!

255
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:46,020
Just make stronger flame
clouds than Kaido's.

256
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:47,760
I promise you can do it.

257
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:52,260
Curses! Curses! Curses!

258
00:16:54,380 --> 00:16:56,700
Flame clouds! Come forward!

259
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,800
Yamato, why?

260
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:05,280
How could you leave me all alone?

261
00:17:06,340 --> 00:17:07,760
No, stop whining.

262
00:17:08,060 --> 00:17:11,000
that won't help you can do it you must

263
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:21,897
this is fruitless no stop
stop don't say that you just

264
00:17:21,980 --> 00:17:27,560
need more practice that's
all flame clouds Come forth!

265
00:17:32,340 --> 00:17:33,660
Come forth!

266
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,940
You will be chosen!

267
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:38,520
The lives of my people are at stake!

268
00:17:45,280 --> 00:17:47,980
You will not fall on my capital!

269
00:17:48,460 --> 00:17:50,460
You wicked, wicked bum!

270
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,380
That's a big wolf!

271
00:18:18,100 --> 00:18:20,760
I still have faith in you, Momonosuke.

272
00:18:21,040 --> 00:18:23,240
Flame clouds, come forth!

273
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:24,877
Don't give up.

274
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:27,100
I know you can do it!

275
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:36,000
Vin Smoke Sanji.

276
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:37,897
You're a good dance partner.

277
00:18:37,980 --> 00:18:39,680
I'll teach you some moves.

278
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:41,380
Flying pound!

279
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:52,760
I'm like a funk machine gun, and
you can't stop the beat, you dig it?

280
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:57,380
That was close.

281
00:19:01,120 --> 00:19:03,240
Come on, you've got no rhythm!

282
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:09,820
You've got to show me the good stuff!

283
00:19:11,420 --> 00:19:15,040
I want to see German Double
Six's combat suit now! Wow!

284
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,040
Sanji, no!

285
00:19:24,660 --> 00:19:27,057
You brought out your suit
when you were fighting King.

286
00:19:27,140 --> 00:19:28,380
Why is he special?

287
00:19:28,620 --> 00:19:30,620
It made you darn invisible, right?

288
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:33,537
That's Judge's handiwork
if I've ever seen it.

289
00:19:33,620 --> 00:19:35,914
You really know how to push my buttons.

290
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:39,607
Oh, I'm feeling weird again.

291
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:41,791
Wear the suit, you tease.

292
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:42,957
Come on, Vinsmoke.

293
00:19:43,040 --> 00:19:45,317
How thick is your head, you stupid lizard?

294
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:47,459
You don't know my family situation.

295
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:49,776
I don't even think of them as family.

296
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:52,360
I'm not wearing that shit.

297
00:19:57,800 --> 00:19:59,700
Now get ready, Tucker.

298
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:02,900
Black Coffee Bean!

299
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:11,220
Now Diable Jabra.

300
00:20:13,040 --> 00:20:14,120
Huh? Ha-ha!

301
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:15,640
Oh-ho-ho!

302
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:20,920
In quick!

303
00:20:26,860 --> 00:20:28,380
Carol shot!

304
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:03,080
That kick didn't hurt at all!

305
00:21:05,060 --> 00:21:07,236
This is gonna take something special.

306
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:09,600
This lizard isn't going down easy.

307
00:21:12,180 --> 00:21:16,997
That's a pretty good kick For
a meat bag Just to be sporting

308
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:21,340
I'll show you the power of a
dinosaur raw As nature intended

309
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:27,080
You're about to experience 100 million
years of evolutionary perfection

310
00:21:35,840 --> 00:21:40,940
Bow down, puty humans It's
time for a history lesson.

311
00:21:49,120 --> 00:21:49,950
Are you ready?

312
00:21:50,033 --> 00:21:52,220
Because here comes prehistoric power!

313
00:21:53,220 --> 00:21:56,200
Stop crying, begging, cowering in fear!

314
00:21:59,260 --> 00:22:00,620
Here I go!

315
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:11,700
Brachiosnakeia!

316
00:22:14,260 --> 00:22:15,660
What?

317
00:22:16,620 --> 00:22:17,450
What?

318
00:22:18,980 --> 00:22:21,500
That's how it works?

319
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:28,880
He got me!

320
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:41,517
Looks like I caught you
off guard This is what a

321
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:46,320
brachiosaurus is capable
of I had no idea Damn it

322
00:22:47,260 --> 00:22:50,317
Your squishy human body
is no match For the

323
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:53,000
raw ancient power
coursing through my veins

324
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:02,880
No one's ever escaped from
my brachio-coilus technique!

325
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:05,820
I'll squeeze the life out of you!

326
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,440
Sangoro, no!

327
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:08,660
What can we do?

328
00:23:08,900 --> 00:23:10,194
He's gonna kill Sanji!

329
00:23:10,660 --> 00:23:12,380
That dinosaur man is right!

330
00:23:12,560 --> 00:23:13,678
Humans are squishy!

331
00:23:13,820 --> 00:23:15,740
He'll crush him! Sanji!

332
00:23:19,820 --> 00:23:21,120
I had no clue.

333
00:23:21,380 --> 00:23:23,968
The strength of dinosaurs
defies all reason.

334
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:25,120
Fy, Fungaro!

335
00:23:27,760 --> 00:23:31,840
Not even a master of conquerors
Haki could escape this.

336
00:23:32,080 --> 00:23:34,117
The pressure will shadow your bones,

337
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:38,494
crush your internal organs, and compress
your body into a human meatball.

338
00:23:38,820 --> 00:23:42,877
But since you're judges, boy,
I'll cut you a sweet deal.

339
00:23:42,960 --> 00:23:46,780
Show me Jerma's power
suit and I'll let you go!

340
00:23:47,520 --> 00:23:49,873
Beat's getting squeezed to paste, right?

341
00:23:50,780 --> 00:23:51,840
Go to hell!

342
00:24:00,100 --> 00:24:01,520
Take a look over there!

343
00:24:01,800 --> 00:24:03,400
You see my torso and legs?

344
00:24:03,520 --> 00:24:07,277
They would be totally useless right
now if I was a normal Brachiosaurus!

345
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:09,180
But I'm better than normal!

346
00:24:09,500 --> 00:24:11,060
I'm a scientist!

347
00:24:16,600 --> 00:24:20,400
I equipped my useless torso
with powerful weapons.

348
00:24:20,780 --> 00:24:24,600
My genius sees a problem in
nature and improves upon it.

349
00:24:24,800 --> 00:24:26,300
Their voice activated.

350
00:24:26,640 --> 00:24:29,757
All I gotta do is call their
name and they'll fire on you.

351
00:24:29,840 --> 00:24:31,940
They're called Brachio Launchers.

352
00:24:34,100 --> 00:24:36,200
They fire, but why?

353
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:41,497
I was just saying the
name conversationally.

354
00:24:41,580 --> 00:24:42,680
Stupid torso!

355
00:24:43,080 --> 00:24:46,597
You're only supposed to fire when
I get it like a cool technique!

356
00:24:46,680 --> 00:24:47,621
BRACIOLAUNCHERS!

357
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:51,280
Master Queen, no!

358
00:24:56,380 --> 00:24:59,240
At least I know the
blasters are effective.

359
00:25:00,600 --> 00:25:03,760
Anyway, my constriction
technique did the job.

360
00:25:04,020 --> 00:25:05,020
The fight's over.

361
00:25:05,780 --> 00:25:07,200
You're already dead.

362
00:25:07,540 --> 00:25:09,197
I just came to bury you.

363
00:25:09,280 --> 00:25:12,680
Who knows how many broken
bones he has after all that.

364
00:25:13,200 --> 00:25:17,140
And what's worse, his organs
are probably a mess as well.

365
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:19,080
Our choice is clear.

366
00:25:19,380 --> 00:25:21,840
We must use the mink medicine. Okay.

367
00:25:34,180 --> 00:25:36,500
You're crooked. Are you okay?

368
