I guess so.

369
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:42,120
I mean, it hurts, but it seems
like I can walk at least.

370
00:25:44,020 --> 00:25:47,100
Freaky, you didn't turn
into a zombie, did you?

371
00:25:47,460 --> 00:25:49,080
What do you mean, zombie?

372
00:25:56,540 --> 00:25:57,840
Guess that works.

373
00:25:58,500 --> 00:26:01,900
But what happened to me,
it's really freaking me out.

374
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:05,480
I know this power.

375
00:26:06,080 --> 00:26:07,660
Did something trigger it?

376
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:09,760
Am I going to end up like them?

377
00:26:11,380 --> 00:26:12,210
Hey!

378
00:26:12,293 --> 00:26:13,200
Stay focused!

379
00:26:13,680 --> 00:26:14,920
Look behind you!

380
00:26:15,320 --> 00:26:18,220
The last time I got
hit was just like this.

381
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:20,520
I'll finish you this time!

382
00:26:22,960 --> 00:26:24,200
Ow, the hell?

383
00:26:31,600 --> 00:26:32,430
What?!

384
00:26:38,600 --> 00:26:39,580
No.

385
00:26:47,920 --> 00:26:51,420
I don't want to become
a monster like them!
